# Privacy Policy for Tasbih Pro – Dhikr Counter

**Effective Date:** August 2026

## Privacy Policy

Thank you for using **Tasbih Pro – Dhikr Counter** ("the App"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it.

This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use our application.

---

## 1. Information We Collect

Tasbih Pro is designed to work without requiring users to create an account or provide personal information.

We do not directly collect personal information such as:

* Name
* Email address
* Phone number
* Home address
* Payment information

---

## 2. Local Data Storage

The App stores certain information locally on your device to provide its functionality, including:

* Counter values
* Dhikr targets and goals
* Statistics and streaks
* User preferences and settings
* Reminder configurations

This information remains on your device and is not transmitted to us.

---

## 3. Advertising

The App uses **Google AdMob** to display advertisements.

AdMob may collect and process information such as:

* Device identifiers
* Advertising ID
* IP address
* Device information
* App interaction data

This information is used by Google and its partners to provide and improve advertising services.

For more information, please review Google's Privacy Policy:

[https://policies.google.com/privacy](https://policies.google.com/privacy)

---

## 4. Analytics

The App may use analytics services to understand app performance, improve stability, and enhance user experience.

Any information collected through analytics is aggregated and does not personally identify you.

---

## 5. Notifications

If you enable reminder notifications, the App may schedule local notifications on your device.

Notification schedules and settings are stored locally and are not shared with us.

---

## 6. Children's Privacy

The App is not directed toward children under the age of 13.

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

If you believe a child has provided personal information through the App, please contact us and we will take appropriate action.

---

## 7. Data Security

We take reasonable measures to protect user data stored by the App.

However, no method of electronic storage or transmission is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.

---

## 8. Third-Party Services

The App may use third-party services including:

* Google AdMob
* Google Play Services
* Firebase Analytics (if enabled)

These services may collect information according to their own privacy policies.

---

## 9. Your Rights

Depending on your location, you may have rights regarding your personal information, including:

* Access to information
* Deletion of information
* Restriction of processing
* Objection to processing

Since most data is stored locally on your device, you may remove it by clearing the App's data or uninstalling the App.

---

## 10. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.

Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated effective date.

